#VRML V2.0 utf8
# WaveShare Core2350B (RP2350B) module - 25.4 x 25.4 mm, 1.00 mm thick.
# Sits 2.54 mm off the carrier on header spacers; components face away from
# the carrier. Tallest point is the USB-C shell at 6.80 mm, and it hangs
# 1.00 mm past the -Y edge of the module.
# Board outline and the USB edge come from the footprint; the flash, crystal
# and buttons are a single envelope because no WaveShare drawing was available.
# 1 unit = 2.54 mm.
